              { textOffset: 114, responses: [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], nextTopics: [1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0] },
              { textOffset: 728, responses: [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], nextTopics: [2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0] },
            ],
            textPool: "Ah!  Hello!\u0000Good luck to you.\u0000I am Irislav.  I am glad to see that someone is still alive.  Did \nyou come alone?\u0000#1Yes.\u0000~1My friend, I must tell you we have not much time.  We must find our way out of this building as quickly as possible. ^1For two hours our communications links have been severed.  Using the satellite aerials on the roof, I have managed to learn some important information.  Genoq is aware of our difficulties here, but they are not sending rescuers.  Quite the opposite. ^1They wish to cover up this disaster and their furtive involvement in weapons.  Thirty five minutes ago the corporation dispatched a fighter-bomber from Sri Lanka.  In twenty minutes it should reach Singapore and attack this building.\u0000#2Why?\u0000~2I would guess they planned for such a contingency.  It would be  disasterous for them if the world found out that they produced biological weapons.  They are determined to destroy any evidence and any witnesses. ^1Unfortunately, I have been unable to contact the authorities.  You must escape from here as quickly as possible and inform the government so that they may halt the attack craft.  If you do not escape before the war plane arrives, then we will all burn with the building. \u0000",
          },
        },
