              { textOffset: 302, responses: [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], nextTopics: [3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0] },
              { textOffset: 776, responses: [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], nextTopics: [4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0] },
            ],
            textPool: "Ah, Dude!\u0000Later.\u0000No way, you made it!\u0000#0What do you mean?\u0000~0I knew you were coming.  Don't ask me why:  I just know.  I read the connections around me -- the events, the causal links.  It's a kind of prescience.  Sometimes when I'm lucky I can see what is about to happen.\u0000#1Who are you?\u0000~1I'm Gonzo.\u0000#2What's going on around here?\u0000~2Our deeds have brought us to the brink of the Apocalypse.  Not only are our lives endangered for so many reasons, but our humanity is at stake.   The technology you have seen in this building is serving to blur the distinction between the living and the merely animate. ^1What was once the domain of humanity is now shared with our own creations.  Soon we may be supplanted, our position usurped by these organisms created in our own image.\u0000#3Can you tell me where Derrida is?\u0000~3No.  But I can tell you that you were brought here for a reason other than you think.  You should take this as a warning, but it won't do you much good -- what will happen has already happened. ^1Dude, I will see you again sometime.\u0000",
          },
